; Botched! map resource
; id: shuntworks-01
; name: Shunt Works
; description: G2-D playtest: three pits (a trident) in the middle; push a rival into one for a SHUNT (+8).
; players: 2-4
;
; Pits at (4,4), (6,4) and (5,6). Dispenser G1 sits at (5,3) between the two upper pits, so the central crate
; is a risky grab with an opponent behind you. A robot that pushes another into a pit (directly, down a chain
; of robots, or from a belt) scores +8 SHUNT; so does the pusher of a robot that later walks or is carried into
; a pit in the same round. Walking into a pit yourself scores nobody anything. The walls give cover and
; corridors so a push line has to be set up.
